cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "SZ-hiPSC-DHM-Calcium-UNet: Multimodal Imaging Analysis and Disease-State Classification of Schizophrenia hiPSC-Derived Neurons"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Yazdani"
    given-names: "Zahra"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-7134-8445"

abstract: >-
  A computational pipeline for U-Net-based cell-body and neurite
  segmentation, multimodal analysis of digital holographic microscopy
  quantitative phase and calcium fluorescence images, feature extraction,
  and disease-state classification of schizophrenia and healthy control
  hiPSC-derived neuronal cultures.

keywords:
  - schizophrenia
  - hiPSC-derived neurons
  - digital holographic microscopy
  - quantitative phase imaging
  - calcium imaging
  - U-Net
  - semantic segmentation
  - machine learning
  - disease-state classification
  - computational neuroscience

repository-code: "https://github.com/zyazdani-92/SZ-hiPSC-DHM-Calcium-UNet"

url: "https://github.com/zyazdani-92/SZ-hiPSC-DHM-Calcium-UNet"

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-08-13"
